menu "AirGradient Go"

    config GO_PORTABLE_PROV_RADIO_IDLE_MS
        int "Portable provisioning Wi-Fi radio idle timeout (ms)"
        range 10000 600000
        default 90000
        help
            In Portable mode, attached Wi-Fi provisioning brings the Wi-Fi
            radio up on demand for a scan / connect and drops it again to
            preserve the Portable power profile. This bounds how long the
            radio stays powered after the last scan/credentials request even
            while the app remains connected on the BLE link. The timer is
            armed/re-armed on every request and cancelled when the radio
            drops (on connect verify-then-drop, BLE disconnect, or mode exit).

    config TRACKING_FSYNC_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Tracking fsync interval (ms)"
        range 1000 600000
        default 30000
        help
            Maximum age of unsynced route points before append_route_point()
            forces an fflush + fsync. Bounds worst-case data loss on a
            power cut. Lower = safer; higher = less NAND wear.

endmenu
